Física III — Bernhard Johannes Lesche, UFJF (@em-lesche: 0, is #reference, #part-of @em-sources) { r_0A3ZH3ZNQ5PGJ4Y05BSSCBAJE7
Bernhard Johannes Lesche, Universidade Federal de Juiz de Fora. [Complete Física III notes and chapter index](https://www2.ufjf.br/fisica/disciplinas/notas-de-aulas/bernhard-johannes-lesche/fisica-iii/).

Use the full Portuguese notes as an introductory companion: charge and field, flux/Gauss, potential, capacitance and dielectrics, current and circuits, magnetic forces, Hall effect, Biot–Savart/Ampère and the later field development. Work examples and activities, not merely the table of topics. Move to the advanced texts for graduate mathematical depth.

The institutional index and named chapter contents were checked on 29 October 2026. A specific original edition year or blanket CC licence was not established. Free teaching access is distinct from permission to adapt every figure or passage. All course files remain external links.

